# Arrow_Left - the left chevron ("previous"). Arrow's drawing mirrored, but painted for the same top-left light (not
# a flipped copy): here the upper arm's outer edge faces the light and takes the highlight, its inner edge turns
# away; the lower arm is the darker one and its bottom end sits in shadow.
size 16 16
symmetric y
key
  K #2a1606  outline (darkest gold-brown)
  h #fff4b8  highlight
  g #ffd65a  gold light
  G #e8a830  gold
  d #a8661a  gold shadow
